  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Greeting and saying goodbye",
   "texto": [
    "**Merhaba** serves at any time. **Günaydın** is good morning; **iyi akşamlar**, good evening / night when you arrive.",
    "To say goodbye, who leaves says **hoşça kal** to the person who stays; who stays responds **güle güle** to the person who leaves.",
    "**Lütfen** means «Please.» and **teşekkürler**, «Thank you.»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ask what's up?",
   "texto": [
    "**Nasılsın?** is informal, for one person. You answer **İyiyim** (I'm fine) or **İyiyim, teşekkürler** (well, thank you).",
    "**Nasılsınız?** is the courteous or plural form. The **-sınız** termination marks the formal / plural treatment."
   ]
  },
